{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12302150","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12302150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1230215001:1":{"text":"맞아요. 이 지역은 울창한 초목으로 가득하죠.","source_cn":"没错，这片地区长满了茂盛的植被。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6CD01FA7CA8EF1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230215002:1":{"text":"성에 사는 사람에게 들었는데, 여긴 벌목장도 있대요.","source_cn":"我听城里的居民说，这里还有专门的伐木场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x521E48A9795EE632","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230215003:1":{"text":"하지만 이렇게 울창한 숲에서 신들의 무덤 유적은 하나도 발견하지 못했어요.","source_cn":"这片茂盛的森林之中，我们没发现一处神陨时代的遗址。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFCB6E240C87C140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230215004:1":{"text":"설마 주민들이 전부 파괴한 걸까요? 그건 거대한 고고학적 손실이에요!","source_cn":"难道都被当地居民破坏了？！那可是考古学上的巨大损失！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC7CD1A1096E7369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者韦恩":{"text":"상록수 학자 웨인","source":"冬青学者韦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冬青学者丝道瑞":{"text":"상록수 학자 시드레아","source":"冬青学者丝道瑞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}